A definition behind an alternating container prefix registers at the innermost content column

```
- > - - x
  >     [r]: /url

See [r][].
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <ul>
            <li>x
[r]: /url</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>See [r][].</p>
```

```
- > - - x
  >     [^f]: note

See [^f].
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <ul>
            <li>x
[^f]: note</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>See [^f].</p>
```

```
- > - - x
  >     # h
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <ul>
            <li>x
# h</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

